  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;div&gt;The scale, siting and design of the proposed development is&amp;nbsp; considered harmful to the appearance of the house, built form of the terrace and character of the area. The addition of a two-storey side extension of this size will fail to appear as subordinate to the terrace dwelling and introduce a staggered roof form which is not considerate to the existing character and design of the terrace dwelling and area.&amp;nbsp; As such, the proposed development is contrary to:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: &quot; pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot;&gt;-\r\nNational Planning Policy Framework &lt;/span&gt;National Planning Policy Framework\r\n(NPPF) (DLUHC, 2023)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &quot; pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot;&gt;- Policy D4 of the\r\nLondon Plan (March 2021)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt;&quot;&gt;- The Residential\r\nExtensions and Alterations Supplementary Planning Document (February 2012)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: &quot; pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot;&gt;-\r\nPolicies SP2, DMD1 and DMD6 of &lt;/span&gt;The London Borough of Barking and\r\nDagenham’s Local Plan 2037: (September 2024)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;"
